    {
      "id": "7674EB10E76B8916",
      "title": "&f&lBlood Mage&r",
      "description": [
        "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
        "&fUnderstand the Blood Mage playstyle and its tradeoffs.",
        "",
        "&fMore Blood-school power; lower Holy power, maximum health and melee damage. These are the subclass’s starting tradeoffs and direction, not your character’s final stat totals.",
        "",
        "&6&l◇ HOW TO&r",
        "&61. &fCompare the subclass root with your other two options.",
        "&62. &fInspect its three paths: Sanguine Power · Sacrifice · Crimson Mastery.",
        "&63. &fChoose and invest in the personal skilltree when you are ready.",
        "",
        "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
        "&fRead health-related costs before casting. A low-health character needs a reliable recovery plan.",
        "",
        "&7Reading check · Mark this when you understand the guide.",
        "",
        "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
      ],
