    {
      "id": "4EFBB39BF1D8AC05",
      "title": "&f&lNecromancer&r",
      "description": [
        "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
        "&fUnderstand the Necromancer playstyle and its tradeoffs.",
        "",
        "&fSupports summon damage when that attribute exists, otherwise the script uses its spell-power fallback. More mana; lower Fire, Ice and Lightning power. These are the subclass’s starting tradeoffs and direction, not your character’s final stat totals.",
        "",
        "&6&l◇ HOW TO&r",
        "&61. &fCompare the subclass root with your other two options.",
        "&62. &fInspect its three paths: Summoning · Grave Reserve · Lord of the Dead.",
        "&63. &fChoose and invest in the personal skilltree when you are ready.",
        "",
        "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
        "&fThe tree strengthens supported summons; obtain and test the actual summon spell separately.",
        "",
        "&7Reading check · Mark this when you understand the guide.",
        "",
        "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
      ],
